[TEXT] ## Phase 3 — Symptom-First Diagnosis

**Active lead:** Router1 has no routes to 192.168.1.0/24 or 192.168.2.0/24, causing "Destination Net Unreachable" for all office/principle → CS/IT traffic. Router0 (FRR `systemd=failed`) is the suspect — if its routing daemon (ripd) is down, it never advertises its subnets.

